      "defect": "citation-inaccurate",
      "evidence": "[L2] asserts \"For every R-module M, one has \\widehat M/I^n\\widehat M \\cong M/I^nM\" and cites cor-completion-commutes-with-finite-quotients-and-submodules. That corollary's Statement assumes \"N \\subseteq M be finitely generated R-modules\" (lines 29-30), so it does not license the asserted universal quantifier over every R-module.",
